docs {
  # FinanceService.RegisterPayment

  Settles the chosen charges, or the oldest pending ones

  `/ltedu.finance.v1.FinanceService/RegisterPayment` · unary · `ltedu/finance/v1/finance.proto`

  ## Request — `RegisterPaymentRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `student_id` | `string` |  |
  | `paid_on` | `string` |  |
  | `amount` | `int64` |  |
  | `method` | `string` |  |
  | `reference` | `string` |  |
  | `payer` | `string` |  |
  | `notes` | `string` |  |
  | `charge_ids` | `repeated string` | Empty: the oldest pending charges |

  ## Response — `RegisterPaymentResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `payment` | `Payment` |  |

